    </exercise>
    <exercise number="19" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\left( {0,3} \right)$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$x\ne 1; x\ne 1;$$ when we solve this we get $$x=1, x=1,$$ which is excluded, therefore NO solution</paragraph>
