      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$x\ne 0; x\ne 0;$$ $$x=- 5 2 x=- 5 2$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, find the equation of the line using the point-slope formula. Write all the final equations using the slope-intercept form.</paragraph>
